This directory can contain any extra source and text files,
which are not required to run the game.

The files won't be committed into source control repository and
won't be packaged for deployment.
It can contains notes, docs, tools, tests, data files, etc...

In this project (it *is* in our git repository; the note above is about BGA's):
  art/          box art (.png, and the GIMP source .xcf), title.png for the
                Metadata Manager, and the 50px flaming-ampersand icon. They are
                uploaded through BGA's Metadata Manager, never deployed.
  img-drafts/   SVG drafts that never made it into img/.
  gamehelp.wiki the condensed rules for BGA's Gamehelpironandwhisper wiki page.
